      "id": "cause-mix-do-not-honour-x3",
      "family": "world",
      "label": "DO_NOT_HONOUR 3x more likely, model refitted",
      "refit": true,
      "why": "The cause composition is the shift that attacks the diagnosis layer the whole project rests on, and DO_NOT_HONOUR is the vague-but-retryable cause the taxonomy handles worst. Applied to TRAIN and TEST together, so the agent learns the tilted world and the row isolates composition from staleness."
